#: source/store/math-notation.md:1
msgid "Appendix: Math notation"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/math-notation.md:3
msgid ""
"A few times in this manual, formal \"proof trees\" are used for [natural "
"deduction](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natural_deduction)\\-style "
"definition of various [relations](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Relation_(mathematics))."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/math-notation.md:5
msgid ""
"The following grammar and assignment of metavariables to syntactic "
"categories is used in these sections."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/math-notation.md:7
msgid ""
"\\\\begin{align} s, t &\\in \\text{store-path} \\\\\\\\ o &\\in "
"\\text{output-name} \\\\\\\\ i, p &\\in \\text{deriving-path} \\\\\\\\ d "
"&\\in \\text{derivation} \\\\end{align}"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/math-notation.md:14
msgid ""
"\\\\begin{align} \\\\text{deriving-path} \\quad p &::= s \\mid (p, o) \\"
"\\end{align}"
msgstr ""
